        {
            "title": "香港零售｜迪生3間名店結業 太古廣場Harvey Nichols 預期倘若續租該店將會出現虧損",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1083\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5531b594776c74bd9bfd25942c30f2102ff22a516043c900df004bdd81827379/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fbossmind_356%2F581cacc4d441662572f47ccf5ca15882.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">廸生創建（0113）公布截至9月底的中期業績，純利1.47億元，按年下跌1.7%，每股盈利38.2仙，中期息減20%至8仙。公司亦預告將關閉本港3間店舖。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">期內收入為9.65億元，按年下跌0.8%；毛利4.6億元，按年上升1.3%。集團表示，期內香港銷售營業額下降約7.9%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">廸生創建預告將關閉香港3間店舖：金鐘太古廣場的Harvey Nichols、旺角銀行中心的Beauty Avenue，以及置地廣場的廸生鐘錶珠寶。集團指，由於預期香港銷售時裝及美容名貴品牌的大型店舖零售市場持續疲弱、經營成本高昂，在與業主就續租條款進行友好磋商後，決定不再續租太古廣場Harvey Nichols店，該店將於明年年中結業。Beauty Avenue及置地廣場廸生鐘錶珠寶店亦不再續租，兩店均計劃明年上半年結業。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-20b7c086-9328-34a5-9c39-3329a07a252c-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">集團表示，上述店舖結業預計會對未來表現帶來負面影響，並可能影響日後派發的股息。實際影響程度，公司未有在資料中披露。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">然而，廸生創建計劃明年在另一地點開設一間廸生鐘錶珠寶精品店，專門銷售「蕭邦」腕錶及珠寶。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">集團表示，日後不計劃開設任何大型時裝及美容店鋪，並會積極尋找零售業務以外的新策略性投資。集團將繼續以最保守方式管理零售網絡，並嚴格控制各營運層面的成本。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%9B%B6%E5%94%AE-%E8%BF%AA%E7%94%9F3%E9%96%93%E5%90%8D%E5%BA%97%E7%B5%90%E6%A5%AD-%E5%A4%AA%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%A3%E5%A0%B4harvey-nichols-%E9%A0%90%E6%9C%9F%E5%80%98%E8%8B%A5%E7%BA%8C%E7%A7%9F%E8%A9%B2%E5%BA%97%E5%B0%87%E6%9C%83%E5%87%BA%E7%8F%BE%E8%99%A7%E6%90%8D-064903788.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-27 15:02:05",
